{"seq":1,"slug":"dap-architecture","title":"DAP 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/dap-architecture","wordCount":1069,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"dap-架构\">DAP 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>DAP 要解决的核心问题是<strong>调试器与编辑器的解耦</strong>：市面上有 GDB、LLDB、Node Inspector 等各不相同的调试器，也有 VS Code、Neovim 等各不相同的编辑器。DAP 在两者之间插入一个「调试适配器」，把 N×M 的适配工作降为 N+M。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调试适配器</td>\n<td>在 DAP 与调试器原生命令之间做翻译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息三分类</td>\n<td>请求 / 响应 / 事件，用 seq 关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Launch vs Attach</td>\n<td>启动新进程 vs 附加已有进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话生命周期</td>\n<td>initialize → configurationDone → terminated</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力协商</td>\n<td>客户端与适配器声明各自支持的特性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DAP 与 LSP 同源（都源自微软的编辑器协议家族），但方向不同——LSP 是双向对等，DAP 主要是客户端驱动、适配器被动响应并主动推送事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调试适配器协议概述\">调试适配器协议概述</h2><p>Debug Adapter Protocol（DAP）是微软在 LSP 成功之后推出的另一个编辑器协议，专注于调试场景。DAP 的核心思想是将调试器（如 GDB、LLDB、Node.js Inspector）与编辑器之间的通信标准化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ProtocolMessage {&#10;  seq: number;&#10;  type: &#39;request&#39; | &#39;response&#39; | &#39;event&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Request extends ProtocolMessage {&#10;  type: &#39;request&#39;;&#10;  command: string;&#10;  arguments?: object;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Response extends ProtocolMessage {&#10;  type: &#39;response&#39;;&#10;  request_seq: number;&#10;  success: boolean;&#10;  command: string;&#10;  message?: string;&#10;  body?: object;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Event extends ProtocolMessage {&#10;  type: &#39;event&#39;;&#10;  event: string;&#10;  body?: object;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtocolMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  seq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'request'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'response'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtocolMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'request'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  arguments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtocolMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'response'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  request_seq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  success</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtocolMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    EDITOR[编辑器 / IDE] &lt;--&gt;|DAP| DA[调试适配器]&#10;    DA &lt;--&gt;|调试器协议| DBG[调试器引擎]&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;VS Code / Neovim&quot;&#10;        EDITOR&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Debug Adapter&quot;&#10;        DA&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;GDB / LLDB / Node Inspector&quot;&#10;        DBG&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    EDITOR[编辑器 / IDE] &lt;--&gt;|DAP| DA[调试适配器]\n    DA &lt;--&gt;|调试器协议| DBG[调试器引擎]\n\n    subgraph \"VS Code / Neovim\"\n        EDITOR\n    end\n    subgraph \"Debug Adapter\"\n        DA\n    end\n    subgraph \"GDB / LLDB / Node Inspector\"\n        DBG\n    end</pre><p>DAP 与 LSP 的核心对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>LSP</th>\n<th>DAP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输协议</td>\n<td>JSON-RPC 2.0</td>\n<td>自定义（类 JSON-RPC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息类型</td>\n<td>请求/响应/通知</td>\n<td>请求/响应/事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息序号</td>\n<td>id 字段</td>\n<td>seq / request_seq</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要方向</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>主要客户端→适配器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件推送</td>\n<td>通知（无 id）</td>\n<td>Event（有 seq）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输通道</td>\n<td>stdin/stdout/TCP/WebSocket</td>\n<td>stdin/stdout/TCP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> DAP 的消息帧格式与 LSP 相同，使用 Content-Length 头 + <code>\\r\\n\\r\\n</code> 分隔 + JSON 消息体。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"调试适配器作为中间层\">调试适配器作为中间层</h2><p>调试适配器（Debug Adapter）充当编辑器与底层调试器之间的翻译层。它将 DAP 请求转换为调试器的原生命令，并将调试器的输出转换为 DAP 事件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class DebugAdapter {&#10;  handleRequest(request: Request): Response {&#10;    switch (request.command) {&#10;      case &#39;setBreakpoints&#39;:&#10;        return this.handleSetBreakpoints(request);&#10;      case &#39;continue&#39;:&#10;        return this.handleContinue(request);&#10;      case &#39;next&#39;:&#10;        return this.handleNext(request);&#10;      case &#39;stackTrace&#39;:&#10;        return this.handleStackTrace(request);&#10;      case &#39;variables&#39;:&#10;        return this.handleVariables(request);&#10;      default:&#10;        return this.errorResponse(request, `Unknown command: ${request.command}`);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DebugAdapter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  handleRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (request.command) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'setBreakpoints'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleSetBreakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'continue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleContinue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleNext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'stackTrace'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleStackTrace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'variables'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleVariables</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">errorResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Unknown command: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">request</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">command</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant DA as 调试适配器&#10;    participant RT as 运行时/调试器&#10;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: setBreakpoints (DAP)&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;RT: break main.js:10 (原生命令)&#10;    RT--&gt;&gt;DA: breakpoint set&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: SetBreakpointsResponse&#10;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: continue (DAP)&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;RT: resume (原生命令)&#10;    RT--&gt;&gt;DA: paused at breakpoint&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event (reason: breakpoint)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant DA as 调试适配器\n    participant RT as 运行时/调试器\n\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: setBreakpoints (DAP)\n    DA-&gt;&gt;RT: break main.js:10 (原生命令)\n    RT--&gt;&gt;DA: breakpoint set\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: SetBreakpointsResponse\n\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: continue (DAP)\n    DA-&gt;&gt;RT: resume (原生命令)\n    RT--&gt;&gt;DA: paused at breakpoint\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event (reason: breakpoint)</pre><p>常见调试适配器实现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言/运行时</th>\n<th>调试适配器</th>\n<th>底层调试器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>vscode-js-debug</td>\n<td>CDP (Chrome DevTools Protocol)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>debugpy</td>\n<td>Python debugger</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C/C++</td>\n<td>cpptools / CodeLLDB</td>\n<td>GDB / LLDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>delve (dlv-dap)</td>\n<td>Delve</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>CodeLLDB</td>\n<td>LLDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>java-debug</td>\n<td>JDI (Java Debug Interface)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.NET</td>\n<td>vsdbg / netcoredbg</td>\n<td>.NET Debugger</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"launch-vs-attach\">Launch vs Attach</h2><p>DAP 支持两种调试启动模式：launch（启动新进程）和 attach（附加到已有进程）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LaunchRequestArguments {&#10;  program: string;&#10;  args?: string[];&#10;  cwd?: string;&#10;  env?: { [key: string]: string };&#10;  stopOnEntry?: boolean;&#10;  console?: &#39;internalConsole&#39; | &#39;integratedTerminal&#39; | &#39;externalTerminal&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface AttachRequestArguments {&#10;  processId?: number;&#10;  port?: number;&#10;  address?: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#