ame\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Attach to Process\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"port\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9229</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"restart\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sourceMaps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>启动方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>进程管理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Launch</td>\n<td>调试适配器启动</td>\n<td>本地开发、单元测试</td>\n<td>适配器管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attach</td>\n<td>附加到已有进程</td>\n<td>远程调试、容器调试、已运行服务</td>\n<td>外部管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>launch.json</code> 的配置项因调试适配器而异。每个适配器通过 <code>configurationAttributes</code> 在 <code>package.json</code> 中声明自己支持的配置属性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"调试会话生命周期\">调试会话生命周期</h2><p>一次调试会话从初始化到终止，经历严格的状态转换。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant DA as 调试适配器&#10;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: initialize&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: InitializeResponse (capabilities)&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: launch / attach&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: LaunchResponse / AttachResponse&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: initialized event&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: setBreakpoints&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: SetBreakpointsResponse&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: configurationDone&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: ConfigurationDoneResponse&#10;    Note over E,DA: 调试会话开始运行&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event (breakpoint)&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: stackTrace / variables / ...&#10;    Note over E,DA: 用户交互调试&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: disconnect / terminate&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: terminated event&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: exited event (exitCode)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant DA as 调试适配器\n\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: initialize\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: InitializeResponse (capabilities)\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: launch / attach\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: LaunchResponse / AttachResponse\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: initialized event\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: setBreakpoints\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: SetBreakpointsResponse\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: configurationDone\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: ConfigurationDoneResponse\n    Note over E,DA: 调试会话开始运行\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event (breakpoint)\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: stackTrace / variables / ...\n    Note over E,DA: 用户交互调试\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: disconnect / terminate\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: terminated event\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: exited event (exitCode)</pre><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Init: initialize&#10;    Init --&gt; Configuring: launch/attach&#10;    Configuring --&gt; Running: configurationDone&#10;    Running --&gt; Stopped: stopped event&#10;    Stopped --&gt; Running: continue/next/stepIn&#10;    Running --&gt; Terminated: terminated event&#10;    Stopped --&gt; Terminated: disconnect&#10;    Terminated --&gt; [*]: exited event\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Init: initialize\n    Init --&gt; Configuring: launch/attach\n    Configuring --&gt; Running: configurationDone\n    Running --&gt; Stopped: stopped event\n    Stopped --&gt; Running: continue/next/stepIn\n    Running --&gt; Terminated: terminated event\n    Stopped --&gt; Terminated: disconnect\n    Terminated --&gt; [*]: exited event</pre><p>会话生命周期中的关键事件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件/请求</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>initialize</td>\n<td>E→DA</td>\n<td>交换能力，协商支持的特性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>launch/attach</td>\n<td>E→DA</td>\n<td>启动或附加调试目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>initialized</td>\n<td>DA→E</td>\n<td>适配器准备就绪，客户端可设置断点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>configurationDone</td>\n<td>E→DA</td>\n<td>初始配置完成，开始执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stopped</td>\n<td>DA→E</td>\n<td>执行暂停（断点、异常、用户暂停）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>continued</td>\n<td>DA→E</td>\n<td>执行恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>terminated</td>\n<td>DA→E</td>\n<td>调试目标终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>exited</td>\n<td>DA→E</td>\n<td>进程退出，携带退出码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"能力协商\">能力协商</h2><p>DAP 的 initialize 请求类似 LSP，用于客户端和适配器之间交换能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InitializeRequestArguments {&#10;  clientID?: string;&#10;  clientName?: string;&#10;  adapterID: string;&#10;  locale?: string;&#10;  linesStartAt1?: boolean;&#10;  columnsStartAt1?: boolean;&#10;  pathFormat?: &#39;path&#39; | &#39;uri&#39;;&#10;  supportsVariableType?: boolean;&#10;  supportsRunInTerminalRequest?: boolean;&#10;  supportsMemoryReferences?: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Capabilities {&#10;  supportsConfigurationDoneRequest?: boolean;&#10;  supportsConditionalBreakpoints?: boolean;&#10;  supportsHitConditionalBreakpoints?: boolean;&#10;  supportsLogPoints?: boolean;&#10;  supportsDataBreakpoints?: boolean;&#10;  supportsStepBack?: boolean;&#10;  supportsReadMemoryRequest?: boolean;&#10;  supportsDisassembleRequest?: boolean;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InitializeRequestArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  clientID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  clientName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  adapterID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  linesStartAt1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  columnsStartAt1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pathFormat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'path'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'uri'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsVariableType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsRunInTerminalRequest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsMemoryReferences</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsConfigurationDoneRequest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsConditionalBreakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsHitConditionalBreakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsLogPoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsDataBreakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsStepBack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsReadMemoryRequest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsDisassembleRequest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力类别</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>断点</td>\n<td>supportsConditionalBreakpoints</td>\n<td>支持条件断点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志点</td>\n<td>supportsLogPoints</td>\n<td>支持不暂停的日志断点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据断点</td>\n<td>supportsDataBreakpoints</td>\n<td>支持变量值变更断点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向执行</td>\n<td>supportsStepBack</td>\n<td>支持回退执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存读取</td>\n<td>supportsReadMemoryRequest</td>\n<td>支持原始内存读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反汇编</td>\n<td>supportsDisassembleRequest</td>\n<td>支持反汇编视图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>linesStartAt1</code> 和 <code>columnsStartAt1</code> 参数控制行列号是从 0 还是从 1 开始。大多数编辑器使用 1-based，但某些调试器内部使用 0-based。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((DAP 架构))&#10;    协议基础&#10;      类 JSON-RPC 消息格式&#10;      请求/响应/事件&#10;      seq 序号追踪&#10;    调试适配器&#10;      编辑器与调试器的桥梁&#10;      协议翻译层&#10;      各语言独立实现&#10;    启动模式&#10;      launch 启动新进程&#10;      attach 附加已有进程&#10;      launch.json 配置&#10;    会话生命周期&#10;      initialize → configurationDone&#10;      stopped / continued 循环&#10;      terminated → exited&#10;    能力协商&#10;      客户端特性声明&#10;      适配器能力返回&#10;      行列号基数协商\">mindmap\n  root((DAP 架构))\n    协议基础\n      类 JSON-RPC 消息格式\n      请求/响应/事件\n      seq 序号追踪\n    调试适配器\n      编辑器与调试器的桥梁\n      协议翻译层\n      各语言独立实现\n    启动模式\n      launch 启动新进程\n      attach 附加已有进程\n      launch.json 配置\n    会话生命周期\n      initialize → configurationDone\n      stopped / continued 循环\n      terminated → exited\n    能力协商\n      客户端特性声明\n      适配器能力返回\n      行列号基数协商</pre><ul>\n<li>DAP 将调试器实现从编辑器中解耦，调试适配器作为<strong>中间翻译层</strong>连接两者。</li>\n<li>协议消息分为<strong>请求、响应和事件</strong>三类，使用 <code>seq</code>/<code>request_seq</code> 进行消息关联。</li>\n<li><strong>Launch</strong> 模式启动新进程，<strong>Attach</strong> 模式附加到已有进程，配置通过 <code>launch.json</code> 管理。</li>\n<li>调试会话遵循 <strong>initialize → launch/attach → configurationDone → stopped/continued 循环 → terminated</strong> 生命周期。</li>\n<li>能力协商通过 initialize 请求完成，<code>linesStartAt1</code> 等参数确保客户端与适配器的坐标系一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DAP 架构","id":"dap-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"调试适配器协议概述","id":"调试适配器协议概述"},{"level":2,"text":"调试适配器作为中间层","id":"调试适配器作为中间层"},{"level":2,"text":"Launch vs Attach","id":"launch-vs-attach"},{"level":2,"text":"调试会话生命周期","id":"调试会话生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"能力协商","id":"能力协商"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/refactoring"},"next":{"title":"断点与单步执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/breakpoints-and-stepping"}}